@startuml
title Trade Platform - High Level Architecture
actor Trader
rectangle "Web / UI Layer" {
  node "Trade UI (React/Next.js)" as UI
}
rectangle "Backend Services (Spring Boot)" {
  component "Gateway Service\n(Spring Cloud Gateway)" as GatewaySvc
  component "Ingress Service\n(Resilience Patterns)" as IngressSvc
  node "Nginx\n(Load Balancer)" as Nginx
  component "Trade Service\n(Business Logic)" as TradeSvc
}
rectangle "Infrastructure" {
  package "Docker Containers" {
    database "MySQL\ntrade_db" as MySQL
    node "Redis Cache" as Redis
    node "Kafka Broker" as Kafka
    database "MongoDB\ntrade_audit_db" as Mongo
    node "Ollama" as LLM
    node "ChromaDB" as VecotorDB
  }
}
rectangle "AI/ Analytics" {
  node "ChromaDB" as VecotorDB
  node "Ollama" as LLM
}
rectangle "Backend Data Services (Python FastAPI)" {
  component "Trade AI Service\n(AI Prompts)" as TradeAiSvc
}
Trader --> UI: HTTP(S)
UI --> GatewaySvc: REST / JSON
GatewaySvc --> IngressSvc: Trade requests
GatewaySvc --> TradeAiSvc: AI features
IngressSvc --> Nginx: Rate limit\nCircuit breaker
Nginx --> TradeSvc: Load balance\nReverse proxy
TradeSvc --> MySQL : CRUD trades
TradeSvc --> Redis : Cache lookups
TradeSvc --> Kafka : Publish trade events
TradeSvc --> Mongo : Write audit logs
Kafka --> TradeAiSvc : Stream trades
TradeAiSvc --> VecotorDB : Store embeddings
TradeAiSvc --> LLM : Query for insights
@enduml

